132
00:12:06.520 --> 00:12:08.370
Rea.

133
00:12:08.470 --> 00:12:12.840
Real oli ilus koer, saba

134
00:12:13.650 --> 00:12:18.290
ja
selle sabaga sai Rea teha 100 imet,

135
00:12:18.650 --> 00:12:24.679
aga kui seda saba harjata, siis sai
selle sabaga teha 101 imet.

136
00:12:24.980 --> 00:12:28.760
Ja seda Rebase reoga tegi,
sest ta tahtis teada,

137
00:12:28.910 --> 00:12:33.200
milline see 101. ime on. Ja.

138
00:12:44.720 --> 00:12:48.770
Olemegi kadus, mina ei tea,
mis nüüd lastega täna koolis küll

139
00:12:48.770 --> 00:12:52.309
