ma panen söögi hakkama.

143
00:13:12.370 --> 00:13:14.100
Kas.

144
00:13:14.200 --> 00:13:18.160
Sina teed täna jälle süüa ja, aga
kus siis?

145
00:13:19.179 --> 00:13:20.970
Memm on.

146
00:13:21.070 --> 00:13:23.950
Taat vista kevadet vaatama.

147
00:13:24.820 --> 00:13:28.110
Ma arvan, et mõmmi memm tahtis ise
ka kangesti vaadata,

148
00:13:28.210 --> 00:13:32.110
