kopsudesse.

177
00:15:49.350 --> 00:15:52.350
Minu arust ei ole see tuba üldse
tühi.

178
00:15:54.840 --> 00:15:59.460
Mommi beebi ootas sind seal vaikselt
nurgas,

179
00:15:59.460 --> 00:16:02.520
nagu tuku-Nui pikisilmi ootas.

180
00:16:03.200 --> 00:16:06.160
Aga mina arvan, et,

181
00:16:06.260 --> 00:16:10.100
Tüdrukud unustasid lihtsalt
mummibeebi siia maha,

182
00:16:10.430 --> 00:16:14.240
